{"kind": "mod", "id": 552, "name": "Josh Mate's Better Backpacks", "slug": "josh-mates-better-backpacks", "teaser": "Makes backpacks bigger in a balanced way", "owner_name": "Josh Mate", "downloads": 113961, "favourites": 1, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": "thumbs/772.jpg", "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:38.000000Z", "created_at": "2022-08-15T13:48:03.000000Z", "published_at": "2022-08-15T13:48:03.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.10.0", "latest_version": "27.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<h3><strong>Josh Mate’s Better Backpacks</strong></h3>\n<h4><strong>Description</strong></h4>\n<p>Makes Backpacks bigger while still staying in line with Vanilla gameplay balance based on price / rarity / weight</p>\n<p><strong>Changes</strong></p>\n<p>- All single grid backpacks have had their sizes increased by about 40%</p>\n<p>- Boss bags (Birds eye radio / Sanitar / Partisan) have been made significantly larger to fit their boss status</p>\n<p>- Bags with multiple grids were increased by less to prevent UI grid overlap issues</p>\n<p>- The field medic bag had its item restrictions removed</p>\n<h4><strong>How to Configure this mod</strong></h4>\n<p>- All backpacks come pre-edited to new bigger but balanced sizes. Just install and play</p>\n<p>- You can edit the values in Mod.ts to your liking</p>\n<p>- Increasing bag sizes too much can cause UI grid over lap issues</p>\n<p>- Increasing bag sizes on backpacks with multiple frame grids can cause UI issues</p>\n<h4><strong>Installation</strong></h4>\n<p>Move the mod’s “user” folder into your SPT AKI folder that contains your user folder.</p>\n<h4><strong>Special Thanks</strong></h4>\n<p>Special thanks to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/3407-nootropix/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Nootropix</a> for the original mod framework<br />\nSpecial thanks to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/10639-jjbeanson/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">JJBeanson</a> for adding the IDs for some missing back packs<br />\nSpecial thanks to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/74614-tedthepraimortis/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">tedthepraimortis</a> for adding the IDs for the new 3.10 back packs</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "16.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.1", "content_length": null, "downloads": 621, "published_at": "2023-10-17T11:01:20.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/552/josh-mates-better-backpacks/16.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "17.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.1", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1984, "published_at": "2023-10-17T20:39:28.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/552/josh-mates-better-backpacks/17.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "18.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.1", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1803, "published_at": "2023-10-25T07:50:50.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/552/josh-mates-better-backpacks/18.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "19.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.1", "content_length": null, "downloads": 14613, "published_at": "2023-11-01T10:09:40.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/552/josh-mates-better-backpacks/19.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "depe